# Expected contents of tul-knx-gateway/tulx32_recovery/ — the recovery system
# for the TULX32 shop variant, built outside this repository (recovery 1.2.3).
#
# The recovery bootloader and the recovery image are frozen at delivery: the
# recovery only ever writes ota_0, and the boards have no USB port, so a wrong
# build cannot be corrected in the field. build_factory.sh therefore refuses to
# assemble a factory image unless these hashes match.
#
# Update these lines deliberately, together with a new recovery release — never
# to make a failing build pass.
54c68a4f8cf3e8e4bf4ffa1aaec0536d51c2eb3fb908aa9cd66c2e8450212283  bootloader.bin
3379ca0f4cfea13ca803d56ee9e6e52b8aac93942ec7c55e130527adabb6e9ae  tulx32_recovery.bin
